   Banks, William E.; d'Errico, Francesco, Univ Bordeaux 1, PACEA,CNRS, UMR 5199, Inst Prehist \& Geol Quaternaire, F-33405 Talence, France.
   d'Errico, Francesco, George Washington Univ, Dept Anthropol, Washington, DC 20052 USA.
   Peterson, A. Townsend, Univ Kansas, Museum Nat Hist, Lawrence, KS 66045 USA.
   Peterson, A. Townsend, Univ Kansas, Biodivers Res Ctr, Lawrence, KS 66045 USA.
   Kageyama, Masa, Univ Paris 10, ArScAn, UMR 7041, F-92023 Nanterre, France.
